flowchart TB
  U[My Day / Tasks / Review Queue] --> I[Open PEMS Task Instance]
  I --> G{Authenticate and check task/seller scope}
  G -->|Denied| X[403 No access]
  G -->|Allowed| C[Fetch immutable Task View Definition for instance]
  C --> S[Shared Task Shell: status, SLA, owner, comments, audit]
  S --> R{Registered View Key}
  R -->|STANDARD_V1| STD[Generic Checklist Task View]
  R -->|OOS_RECON_V1| OOS[OOS Reconciliation Task View]
  R -->|BUYBOX_MONITOR_V1| BB[Buy Box Task View when implemented]
  R -->|Other registered views| OTH[Specialized Task View]
  R -->|Unknown view| SAFE[Safe read-only fallback or clear unsupported error]
  OOS --> RPT[Report uploads and raw source validation]
  OOS --> AFT[Affected ASINs and GMS priorities]
  OOS --> RSL[Resync, incident follow-ups and exports]
  STD --> PERM[Backend business rules / permissions]
  RPT --> PERM
  AFT --> PERM
  RSL --> PERM
  BB --> PERM
  OTH --> PERM
  PERM --> EV[Versioned evidence, task link and audit events]
  EV --> RG{Server submission gate}
  RG -->|Incomplete| BACK[Remain in progress with blockers]
  RG -->|Complete| PEMS[PEMS Review Queue]
  PEMS --> REVIEW{Independent reviewer decision}
  REVIEW -->|Reject| REWORK[Task Rework]
  REVIEW -->|Approve| DONE[Approved daily task]
  DONE --> KEEP[Keep unresolved OOS incidents open with follow-up owner]
